{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bSmJ8deEr21794409663.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港首個成人展原定周五起一連三日舉行，有參展的演員指未能入境，主辦單位指活動取消，稍後會透過官方渠道，公布退款安排。</p><p></p><p>其中一名參展的AV女演員，下午在社交平台發文指，連同經理人及工作人員已經抵達香港。雖然已辦理簽證，但無法入境需要返回日本，指在香港的活動將要取消。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.EXPO-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QgmUfK1JIE1794409968.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>展覽有多名AV女演員任嘉賓，原定周五至周日在富豪機場酒店舉行。主辦單位網頁顯示，活動門票介乎480元至1,620元不等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.EXPO-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zDW676F17W1794409987.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.712213+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:37:11.699726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:30.695266+00:00","content_hash":"3b9fec7b3bf0bc8081c9d5b1257c77ae1f2fc0e1a691f6a70f9e9e74f9cfdc76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.712213+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}